# GMS splits this in two: a buff worth 10+floor(L/2)% final damage on an MP
# cost and a timer, and a passive worth 2L+10% that is always on. Nothing here
# spends MP or watches a timer, so the two are summed and always on -- 22.5% at
# level 1 climbing to 70% at 20.
#
# The other half of the GMS skill cuts damage taken by a share of the HP the
# character is missing. That is dropped: it pays most when nearly dead, and a
# fight that heals a tenth of the pool on every beat never sits there.
name: "Cross Surge"
skill_order: 2
description: "Permanently increases your Final Damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BERSERKER
max_level: 20
base { final_dmg_pct: 0.225 }
per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.025 }
